cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use GridForge, please cite it as below."
title: "GridForge: An Open-Source Physics-Informed Digital Twin and Benchmark for UK 11 kV Underground Distribution Cables"
abstract: >-
  GridForge couples IEC 60287 / IEC 60853 cable thermal physics and Crine
  dielectric-ageing kinetics with a physics-informed neural-network surrogate,
  a calibrated synthetic UK 11 kV cable dataset, and a five-task benchmark,
  providing a common open reference for evaluating cable-monitoring tools.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Musoke
    given-names: "Lilliane Linnet"
version: "0.0.1"
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mlily2024/Gridforge"
keywords:
  - physics-informed neural networks
  - power systems
  - cable monitoring
  - digital twin
  - distribution grid
